## Monthly cost

data cost = option,monthly,annual; Managed Kafka,5850,70200; SQS with SNS,2100,25200; Self-run RabbitMQ,3400,40800

chart bar cost y=monthly unit=$ labels focus="Managed Kafka" title="Monthly cost"

table cost cols=option,monthly,annual

## Risks

- Only 2 of our 9 engineers have run Kafka before, so we budget 5 days of training.
- SQS cannot replay, and a single FIFO queue cannot carry our peak of 4200 messages per second.
- RabbitMQ needs 30 hours of operations a month, and we would build the ordering ourselves.

## Recommendation

Choose Managed Kafka. It costs 3750 dollars a month more than SQS with SNS, and it is the only option with built-in replay of the last 7 days, which audits require. Budget 5 days of training to cover the Kafka experience gap.
